<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>圆盘呼出区</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>呼出区域大小</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>0.3.15：呼出区 = 贴着右缘的一条窄带，从底部往上 35% 高度。两个滑条拖动即时生效，数值与位置实时跟着手指走。把手显隐在一级菜单。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>区域高度：屏高 %</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripZoneH</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>35</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>15</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>50</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>从屏幕底部往上算。35 = 默认（约 326pt 高）；调大才会往屏幕中部延伸，调小则只认更靠近底部的那一段。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>区域宽度：pt</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GripZoneW</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>5</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>1</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>60</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string> </string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>贴着右边缘向内算，单位 pt。5 = 默认（只认真正贴边的手指）；调大到 20~30 更容易划中，但会开始抢右缘附近的横向操作。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
